EPUB is the best format for reading WP stories on e-readers and reading apps. WP Downloader converts any public WP story to EPUB instantly - no account required.

## What is EPUB?

EPUB (Electronic Publication) is an open e-book standard supported by virtually every e-reader and reading app. Unlike PDF, EPUB text reflows to fit any screen size, and you can customise font size, font face, and line spacing in your reader.

## Steps to convert a WP story to EPUB

### 1. Get the story URL

Open the story on Wattpad and copy the URL. It should look like:

```
https://www.wattpad.com/story/123456789-story-title
```

You can also use a direct chapter URL or a reading list URL.

### 2. Paste into WP Downloader

Go to [WP Downloader](/) and paste the story URL into the input field.

### 3. Download as EPUB

**EPUB** is selected by default. No sign-in is needed - just click **Download**.

Your EPUB file will be generated and downloaded in seconds.

### 4. Open in your reader

Transfer the EPUB to your e-reader or open it in a reading app. See [how to read WP stories offline](/help/how-to-read-wattpad-offline/) for instructions for each device.

## EPUB features in WP Downloader

- **Chapters**: Each story chapter is a separate EPUB chapter, easy to navigate.
- **Table of contents**: A full chapter list is included in the EPUB metadata.
- **Images**: Enable Include Images to embed chapter images in the file.
- **Language support**: Stories in Vietnamese, Thai, Sinhala, and other languages are exported with correct character encoding.

## Supported URL types

| URL type | Example |
|---|---|
| Full story | `wattpad.com/story/123456789-title` |
| Single chapter | `wattpad.com/1234567890-chapter-title` |
| Reading list | `wattpad.com/list/123456789` |

## Frequently asked questions

**Do I need an account?**
No. EPUB downloads are completely free with no sign-in required.

**What's the difference between EPUB and PDF?**
EPUB text reflows to fit any screen - great for phones and e-readers. PDF preserves fixed formatting - better for printing. See [WP to PDF](/wattpad-to-pdf/) for PDF downloads.

**Can I convert a whole reading list?**
Yes. Paste your reading list URL and WP Downloader will download all stories in the list as a ZIP file containing individual EPUBs.
